<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>O Lord, just make us such a one:</l><l>A Bride well-pleasing in the Son.</l><l>One to satisfy Your heart;</l><l>O we would fill Thy longing, Lord,</l><l>As Thy sweet counterpart.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>O Lord, do capture every thought,</l><l>Your mind in ours would be inwrought;</l><l>Grant us to see Your economy</l><l>Until that glorious day, dear Lord,</l><l>When You’d be all we see.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>O Lord, grant us the strength to say,</l><l>Our will is Yours in every way;</l><l>You’d move through us to all the earth,</l><l>To show the nations Your unbounded,</l><l>Everlasting worth.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>O Lord, this would be our life’s goal:</l><l>You’d saturate our very soul;</l><l>O Lord we’re crying out to You,</l><l>Make us Your overcoming Bride,</l><l>And see Your purpose through.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
